nd":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"八王亂時域，冏引語之孤/戎引語之公屬冏，卿是冏對戎；兩王群指顒與穎但不拆單代詞。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0256","start":256,"end":258,"surface":"葛旟","kind":"person","person_id":"t29_ix9_yor","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"八王亂時域，冏引語之孤/戎引語之公屬冏，卿是冏對戎；兩王群指顒與穎但不拆單代詞。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0267","start":267,"end":269,"surface":"王公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"葛旟泛論王公，不單指冏。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0276","start":276,"end":278,"surface":"妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"泛論王公家屬，非明確新增配偶子女。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p010:m0293","start":293,"end":294,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"八王亂時域，冏引語之孤/戎引語之公屬冏，卿是冏對戎；兩王群指顒與穎但不拆單代詞。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":82,"last_line":82,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003","text":"冏於是輔政，居攸故宮，置掾屬四十人。大築第館，北取五穀市，南開諸署，毀壞廬舍以百數，使大匠營制，與西宮等。鑿千秋門牆以通西閣，後房施鐘懸，前庭舞八佾，沈於酒色，不入朝見。坐拜百官，符敕三臺，選舉不均，惟寵親昵。以車騎將軍何勖領中領軍。封葛𣄣為牟平公，路秀小黃公，衛毅陰平公，劉真安鄉公，韓泰封丘公，號曰「五公」，委以心膂。殿中御史桓豹奏事，不先經冏府，即考竟之。於是朝廷側目，海內失望矣。南陽處士鄭方露版極諫，主簿王豹屢有箴規，冏並不能用，遂奏豹殺之。有白頭公入大司馬府大呼，言有兵起，不出甲子旬。即收殺之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0058","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0059","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"攸","kind":"person","person_id":"cac_ca2_008","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0060","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"何勖","kind":"person","person_id":"7e9_372_c4a","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0061","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"葛𣄣","kind":"person","person_id":"t29_ix9_yor","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0062","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"路秀","kind":"person","person_id":"3e5_6nq_xm3","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0063","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"衛毅","kind":"person","person_id":"aeg_ljr_nw1","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0064","start":137,"end":139,"surface":"劉真","kind":"person","person_id":"5j1_ztc_dpq","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0065","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"韓泰","kind":"person","person_id":"61s_ato_nlg","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0066","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"五公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"群體／匿名／典故或指代仍待專項辨識，不補造單人。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0067","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"桓豹","kind":"person","person_id":"s1h_881_izr","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0068","start":173,"end":174,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0069","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"鄭方","kind":"person","person_id":"ef7_oyp_oo9","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0070","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"王豹","kind":"person","person_id":"08j_19m_fmz","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0071","start":214,"end":215,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0072","start":222,"end":223,"surface":"豹","kind":"person","person_id":"08j_19m_fmz","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p003:m0073","start":227,"end":230,"surface":"白頭公","kind":"person","person_id":"m4o_mcg_1li","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":96,"last_line":96,"revision_id":2650517},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ws2650517-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011","text":"王室多故，禍難罔已。大司馬冏雖唱義有興復皇位之功，而定都邑，克寧社稷，實成都王勳力也。而冏不能固守臣節，實協異望。在許昌營有東西掖門，官置治書侍御史，長史、司馬直立左右，如侍臣之儀。京城大清，篡逆誅夷，而率百萬之眾來繞洛城。阻兵經年，不一朝覲，百官拜伏，晏然南面。壞樂官市署，用自增廣。輒取武庫秘杖，嚴列不解。故東萊王蕤知其逆節，表陳事狀，而見誣陷，加罪黜徙。以樹私黨，僭立官屬。幸妻嬖妾，名號比之中宮。沈湎酒色，不恤群黎。董艾放縱，無所畏忌，中丞按奏，而取退免。張偉惚恫，擁停詔可，葛旟小豎，維持國命。操弄王爵，貨賂公行。群奸聚黨，擅斷殺生。密署腹心，實為貨謀。斥罪忠良，伺窺神器。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0114","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"大司馬冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0115","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"成都王","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0116","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0117","start":156,"end":160,"surface":"東萊王蕤","kind":"person","person_id":"m3u_w8n_d2k","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0118","start":190,"end":194,"surface":"幸妻嬖妾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"群體／匿名／典故或指代仍待專項辨識，不補造單人。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0119","start":212,"end":214,"surface":"董艾","kind":"person","person_id":"nb1_pou_zx4","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0120","start":232,"end":234,"surface":"張偉","kind":"person","person_id":"y5c_f0t_64f","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p011:m0121","start":242,"end":244,"surface":"葛旟","kind":"person","person_id":"t29_ix9_yor","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":112,"last_line":112,"revision_id":2650517},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ws2650517-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p013","text":"顒表既至，冏大懼，會百僚曰：「昔孫秀作逆，篡逼帝王，社稷傾覆，莫能禦難。孤糾合義眾，掃除元惡，臣子之節，信著神明。二王今日聽信讒言，造構大難，當賴忠謀以和不協耳。」司徒王戎、司空東海王越說冏委權崇讓。冏從事中郎葛旟怒曰：「趙庶人聽任孫秀，移天易日，當時喋喋，莫敢先唱。公蒙犯矢石，躬貫甲胄，攻圍陷陣，得濟今日。計功行封，事殷未遍。三臺納言，不恤王事，賞報稽緩，責不在府。讒言僭逆，當共誅討，虛承偽書，令公就第。漢、魏以來，王侯就第甯有得保妻子者乎！議者可斬。」於是百官震悚，無不失色。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p013:m0131","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p013:m0132","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p013:m0133","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"孫秀","kind":"person","person_id":"8x5_e5i_yle","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之